# the gestures (v0.2): Weight, Shift, Converge, Wash on D5-G5 (w12-w15), offsets on top of the sound, the sound's own
# values untouched; each part comes in over its own stretch of the way in and goes over its own on the way out.
# heardN is what's heard (the sound plus the macros), parN the sound's own, mpitchG a drone's pitch move by the
# macros (cents). 7 drone I's cutoff, 5 its osc mix, 11 its level, 25 drone II's detune, 63 the reverb mix, 42
# cross-mod; 78-81 unused (the set macros, gone); 82-85 the gestures' depths (83: Shift's move), 86-89 their own
# times, 90-93 their latches.
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect heard7 700
# PRESETS: Macro time (50: each gesture's own time)
spin PRESET 10
expect mtime 60
spin PRESET -10
expect mtime 50
# WEIGHT held swells in (2.8 s), a warm bass: half way, the cutoff most of the way down (by 30 at most), the sub
# half way up
key w12 down
wait 1400
expect heard7 <690
expect heard5 >50
expect heard5 <70
wait 1500
expect heard5 >62
key w12 up
wait 1000
expect heard7 >680
expect heard5 >38
wait 2500
expect heard5 30
expect heard7 700
# let go after a short hold: it goes over as long as it was held (1 s), not its own time
key w12 down
wait 1000
key w12 up
expect heard5 >38
wait 1100
expect heard5 30
# let go after a long hold (5 s, in by 2.8 s): it drifts out over 5 s
key w12 down
wait 5000
key w12 up
wait 2500
expect heard5 >38
wait 3000
expect heard5 30
# Macro time x0.1 (PRESETS all the way down): in by about 0.3 s
spin PRESET -50
expect mtime 0
key w12 down
wait 400
expect heard5 >70
key w12 up
wait 600
expect heard5 30
spin PRESET 50
expect mtime 50
# a tap: to its depth, and it stays; a tap again: it goes
tapkey w12
wait 4000
expect par90 100
expect heard5 >62
tapkey w12
wait 4000
expect par90 0
expect heard5 30
# SEL held as you let go: latched where it is
key w12 down
wait 1000
press SEL
key w12 up
release SEL
expect par90 >20
expect par90 <60
tapkey w12
wait 4000
expect par90 0
# SHIFT: held, ALGORITHM picks its move (a 4th down), PRESETS its own time (3.9 s, 4 shorter: 3.4 s)
key w13 down
spin ALGO 2
spin PRESET -4
wait 300
key w13 up
expect par83 2
expect par87 36
expect par75 50
wait 4000
expect mpitch0 0
expect mpitch1 0
# tapped: drone I glides down a 4th first, drone II after it
tapkey w13
wait 1500
expect mpitch0 <-250
expect mpitch1 >-100
wait 3000
expect mpitch0 -500
expect mpitch1 -500
tapkey w13
wait 4500
expect mpitch0 0
expect mpitch1 0
# CONVERGE: drone II's pitch toward a consonance with drone I first (drone I stepping back, quieter, meanwhile),
# never quite there (a few cents short, so they pulse; here they're a fifth already), cross-mod last (3.3 s)
expect heard11 80
key w14 down
wait 1000
expect heard42 0
expect heard11 <72
wait 3000
expect heard42 1
expect heard25 5
expect mpitch1 <-3
expect mpitch1 >-16
expect heard11 80
key w14 up
wait 4500
expect heard42 0
expect mpitch1 0
# a scene keeps the gestures: A1 stored with Wash latched, recalled from none
tapkey w15
wait 5000
expect heard63 >60
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
wait 300
tapkey w15
wait 5000
expect par93 0
expect heard63 35
tapkey w0
wait 5000
expect par93 100
expect heard63 >60
# a restart brings the whole sound back to the engine, the gestures too (the last values of a load were once
# dropped)
tap SAVE
wait 500
reboot
wait 5000
expect par93 100
expect heard63 >60
# SAVE again with nothing changed: nothing is written (each write is a late block while playing)
expect store_writes 1
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect store_writes 1
